{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<statechart xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\">\n  <final id=\"a\"/>\n</statechart>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml001-wrong-root.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":2,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml001-wrong-root.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":12,"endLine":1,"startColumn":2,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"root element must be `scxml` in the W3C SCXML namespace\n\n**Note:** SCXML processors identify documents by the exact expanded name {http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml}scxml; a missing, misspelled, or slash-terminated namespace is a different vocabulary\n\n**Help:** use <scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"> or an equivalent prefix\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.2 <scxml>","text":"root element must be `scxml` in the W3C SCXML namespace"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":11,"start":1},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML001"},{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml001-wrong-root.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":12,"endLine":1,"startColumn":2,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<statechart>` is not an SCXML 1.0 element\n\n**Note:** the W3C SCXML 1.0 schema rejects this under XML Schema constraint `cvc-elt.1`: Element 'statechart' is not declared\n\n**Help:** declare the element in the namespace's schema, or correct its name or namespace\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.3.4 Element Locally Valid (Element) (`cvc-elt.1`)","text":"`<statechart>` is not an SCXML 1.0 element"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":11,"start":1},"category":"schema"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"closing tag of the unknown element"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml001-wrong-root.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":13,"endLine":3,"startColumn":3,"startLine":3}}}],"ruleId":"XSD-cvc-elt.1"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML processors identify documents by the exact expanded name {http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml}scxml; a missing, misspelled, or slash-terminated namespace is a different vocabulary"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: use `<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\">` as the document element.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.2 <scxml>\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML001` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#scxml","id":"SCXML001","name":"SCXML001","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the root element is not `<scxml>` in the SCXML namespace"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"misspelled SCXML elements are not SCXML at all; the schema reports them before any semantic rule can misinterpret the document"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: correct the element name, or move an extension element into its own namespace.\n\nSpecification: XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.3.4 Element Locally Valid (Element)\n\nRun `scx --explain XSD-cvc-elt.1` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-1/#cvc-elt","id":"XSD-cvc-elt.1","name":"XSD-cvc-elt.1","properties":{"category":"schema"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an element is not declared in its namespace"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}